MidPoint 4.11.0 "Čapek"
----------------------

Release 4.11.0 is an eighty-sixth midPoint release code-named Čapek.
The 4.11.0 release brings AI-assisted rapid application onboarding, major security improvements, and numerous improvements for end users, engineers, and administrators.

Release date: 21st October 2026
Release type: Feature release
End of support: 20th October 2028

Please see the release notes for detailed list of changes:
https://docs.evolveum.com/midpoint/release/4.11.0/
